OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 1,275 homes after new
OL,4,Atown bid rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 1,275 homes on green
OL,7,Fbelt land in a village have been
OL,8,Fsubmitted months after a proposal for a
OL,9,Fnew town there was rejected by the
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FMany locals had opposed developing a
OL,13,Fnew town in Adlington, Cheshire, which
OL,14,Fcould have seen the building of 10,000
OL,15,Fhomes, under a plan brought by
OL,16,Fdeveloper Belport.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
