OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 1,275 homes after new
OL,4,Atown bid rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the decision in March, Belport
OL,7,Fsaid it still believed the site was
OL,8,F"viable" and it has now outlined a
OL,9,F"landscape led" proposal for Adlington
OL,10,FPark, saying it would "create a
OL,11,Fbalanced and sustainable new
OL,12,Fcommunity".
OL,14,FSome residents welcomed the new plans
OL,15,Fto fix a housing shortage, while others
OL,16,Fcite a lack of infrastructure and raise
OL,17,Fconcerns over the loss of green belt
OL,18,Fland.
